            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.45.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esk 45:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Koikor loka Yuda, ageun kokide kiton to, ejaun ainakinet naiinakinete, alalauke ikubitin ilukumin akaisaarei ka lukany, aojauke kwape akorakinet adiopet, ageun kokide kiton to: ejaun da aibois nakalaunan kidinike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aojau naka ainakinet naiinakinete mama ejai EJAKAIT eraun ikubitin ilukumin akaisaarei ka lukany, alalauke da ilukumin itomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido ainakinet nakalaunan eraun naka nul, kes isasedotin, agolitomei aoiauke ikubitin ilukumin akaisaarei ka lukany, to alalauke ilukumin itomon, kide alalauke ilukumin itomon, eŋalakimak da aojauke ilukumin akaisaarei ka lukany: ejaun da aibois nakalaunan naka EJAKAIT kidiŋike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
