        },
        {
          "text": "“Atutubet naideuna eraun naka ekapolon, eiduny kainakinet nakalaunan, ka alup nuka ere, epuwai ka epuwai, kosiep loka ikubitin ilukumin akaisaarei ka lukany luka ainakinet atereikin eikor lokokide, kosiep loka ikubitin ilukumin akaisaarei ka lukany atereikin eikor lokoto, atereikina akorakineta, eraun naka ekapolon. Ainakinet nakalaunan, ka aibois nakalaunan naka etogo eiaunete kidiŋike; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 48:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bobo da ageun kalup nuka Ilebin, ka alup nuka ere, nuejaas kidiŋ katutubet naka ekapolon, kidiŋ oikor loka Yuda, ka eikor loka Benyamin, eraunete nuka ekapolon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.48.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.48.22"
            ]
